// The hop names the plate. A disagreed plate does not land.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hop  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1
CUBE plate ROLE observer PROTON 1

PLUG hop plate

IMPULSE hop 1
IMPULSE plate 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY plate
DECIDE plate
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "platehop" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
